{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925400/extras/3bcebb7bc5ff9790dcf9f8d7549252a1.poster.avif?t=1756317202\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925400/extras/3bcebb7bc5ff9790dcf9f8d7549252a1.webm?t=1756317202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925400/extras/3bcebb7bc5ff9790dcf9f8d7549252a1.mp4?t=1756317202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biomass: Extermination is a post-apocalyptic sci-fi first-person shooter that blends exploration and narrative-driven gameplay to deliver an immersive and unique experience. Set in a world devastated by what appears to be an alien invasion, players step into the role of Shepard, the last surviving warrior equipped with a highly advanced nano-tech suit called the Neusuit. This suit grants enhanced speed, strength, and resilience, along with abilities such as slow-motion, teleportation, and jetpack-powered double jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Shepard journeys through a treacherous and atmospheric world, he uncovers a chilling truth: the so-called alien invaders\u2014known as Chimera\u2014are actually mutated humans, victims of a virus engineered by a corrupt elite. The Neusuit\u2019s bio-chip distorts Shepard\u2019s perception, making him see humans as enemies. The game explores this psychological twist while delivering intense combat and meaningful exploration. Players will ally with resistance fighters, unlock the truth hidden in black box messages, and expose the conspiracy threatening what\u2019s left of humanity.\u00a0Integral to Shepard\u2019s journey is the Neusuit, equipped with an advanced AI called <strong>Cyra</strong> (Cybernetic Interactive Response Assistant). Cyra provides continuous support, help, and sometimes humor, making the game more engaging than traversing the wastelands in silence. Cyra's interactions add depth to the gameplay, offering strategic advice, highlighting important story elements, and providing a touch of levity during intense moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The visual tone of Biomass: extermination mixes futuristic tech with the eerie decay of a ruined world. Players will encounter gravity-free zones, anomaly fields, and destructible environments. The soundscape includes a hybrid of electronic and orchestral music, emphasizing atmosphere and tension. The game  draws inspiration from classics like Half-Life, Metro, and Crysis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925400/extras/7fa032af4b42da62e6399f436f44b3e9.poster.avif?t=1756317202\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925400/extras/7fa032af4b42da62e6399f436f44b3e9.webm?t=1756317202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925400/extras/7fa032af4b42da62e6399f436f44b3e9.mp4?t=1756317202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925400?t=1756317202","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925400/9fe6b3246ccd447034c249c41077c9ffa9793513/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756317202","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925400/d4e5d49ada6505a672e69da9d1b668a22faeb8aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756317202","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925400/d4e5d49ada6505a672e69da9d1b668a22faeb8aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756317202","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925400/extras/3bcebb7bc5ff9790dcf9f8d7549252a1.poster.avif?t=1756317202\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925400/extras/3bcebb7bc5ff9790dcf9f8d7549252a1.webm?t=1756317202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925400/extras/3bcebb7bc5ff9790dcf9f8d7549252a1.mp4?t=1756317202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biomass: Extermination is a post-apocalyptic sci-fi first-person shooter that blends exploration and narrative-driven gameplay to deliver an immersive and unique experience. Set in a world devastated by what appears to be an alien invasion, players step into the role of Shepard, the last surviving warrior equipped with a highly advanced nano-tech suit called the Neusuit. This suit grants enhanced speed, strength, and resilience, along with abilities such as slow-motion, teleportation, and jetpack-powered double jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Shepard journeys through a treacherous and atmospheric world, he uncovers a chilling truth: the so-called alien invaders\u2014known as Chimera\u2014are actually mutated humans, victims of a virus engineered by a corrupt elite. The Neusuit\u2019s bio-chip distorts Shepard\u2019s perception, making him see humans as enemies. The game explores this psychological twist while delivering intense combat and meaningful exploration. Players will ally with resistance fighters, unlock the truth hidden in black box messages, and expose the conspiracy threatening what\u2019s left of humanity.\u00a0Integral to Shepard\u2019s journey is the Neusuit, equipped with an advanced AI called <strong>Cyra</strong> (Cybernetic Interactive Response Assistant). Cyra provides continuous support, help, and sometimes humor, making the game more engaging than traversing the wastelands in silence. Cyra's interactions add depth to the gameplay, offering strategic advice, highlighting important story elements, and providing a touch of levity during intense moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The visual tone of Biomass: extermination mixes futuristic tech with the eerie decay of a ruined world. Players will encounter gravity-free zones, anomaly fields, and destructible environments. The soundscape includes a hybrid of electronic and orchestral music, emphasizing atmosphere and tension. The game  draws inspiration from classics like Half-Life, Metro, and Crysis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925400/extras/7fa032af4b42da62e6399f436f44b3e9.poster.avif?t=1756317202\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925400/extras/7fa032af4b42da62e6399f436f44b3e9.webm?t=1756317202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925400/extras/7fa032af4b42da62e6399f436f44b3e9.mp4?t=1756317202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Exterra Production"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925400/ae627a93067e09917bf217eb0c28a8db219d0c14/header.jpg?t=1756317202","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 ExTerra Studio. All rights reserved. Biomass: Extermination and its logo are trademarks of ExTerra Production. All other trademarks, product names, and compan